      ],
      "note": "600 vs 60 state updates per minute (mechanism counter, authoritative); whole-step hw-instruction medians sit inside the noise band (5.0M vs 5.5M), so the declared metric needs a narrower region to separate (measurements-staging)."
    }
  },
